      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IT'S SOYSAGES (5) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (22.79) at this track behind Street Sixty Six in a Grade 5. Chased the leaders and with a clean run can be prominent. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Must come into calculations. SOUTH OF HEAVEN (8) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 0.9 lengths at this track in a handy 22.62 beating Bone Shaker. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Expecting another bold showing. ASTON FLAMENCO (1) doesn't have the best strike-rate but recent form is sound. Finished in the minors last time when third (22.82) at this track making it back to back placings. Solid record here winning two races. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to her credit. Likely to be in the finish again. PAW JUDD (7) cannot be written off despite a miss here at his latest outing.",
